    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/6c7a0f0f32b05bbdcd215cf7f1103b4a.poster.avif?t=1746197746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/6c7a0f0f32b05bbdcd215cf7f1103b4a.webm?t=1746197746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/6c7a0f0f32b05bbdcd215cf7f1103b4a.mp4?t=1746197746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Attic Transit Authority.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s a dusty attic, a pile of wooden train tracks, a sketchy cassette player, a wobbly TV, and some... old toys stashed in a drawer. Build, vibe, and maybe derail your life a little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lay down wooden tracks with real physics \u2014 snap curves, bridges, and janky ramps together just like you remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive trains across your weird creations, build tiny towns, stack scenery until it collapses, and create the attic empire your 6-year-old self always dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dim the lights, pop in a new cassette tape, and watch the attic come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/2ad14f272ec4c14e0cd1a757dcf0bead.poster.avif?t=1746197746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/2ad14f272ec4c14e0cd1a757dcf0bead.webm?t=1746197746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/2ad14f272ec4c14e0cd1a757dcf0bead.mp4?t=1746197746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-based wooden track building</strong> \u2014 curves, bridges, chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playable cassette tapes</strong> \u2014 customize the attic soundtrack as you discover tapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Working CRT TV and VCR</strong> \u2014 watch old films and VHS weirdness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toys everywhere</strong> \u2014 bobble balls, dominoes, cards, secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive your trains</strong> \u2014 or just vibe out and watch the attic spiral into chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nothing bad ever happens here. Probably.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/6c7a0f0f32b05bbdcd215cf7f1103b4a.poster.avif?t=1746197746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/6c7a0f0f32b05bbdcd215cf7f1103b4a.webm?t=1746197746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/6c7a0f0f32b05bbdcd215cf7f1103b4a.mp4?t=1746197746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Attic Transit Authority.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s a dusty attic, a pile of wooden train tracks, a sketchy cassette player, a wobbly TV, and some... old toys stashed in a drawer. Build, vibe, and maybe derail your life a little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lay down wooden tracks with real physics \u2014 snap curves, bridges, and janky ramps together just like you remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive trains across your weird creations, build tiny towns, stack scenery until it collapses, and create the attic empire your 6-year-old self always dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dim the lights, pop in a new cassette tape, and watch the attic come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/2ad14f272ec4c14e0cd1a757dcf0bead.poster.avif?t=1746197746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/2ad14f272ec4c14e0cd1a757dcf0bead.webm?t=1746197746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567650/extras/2ad14f272ec4c14e0cd1a757dcf0bead.mp4?t=1746197746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-based wooden track building</strong> \u2014 curves, bridges, chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playable cassette tapes</strong> \u2014 customize the attic soundtrack as you discover tapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Working CRT TV and VCR</strong> \u2014 watch old films and VHS weirdness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toys everywhere</strong> \u2014 bobble balls, dominoes, cards, secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive your trains</strong> \u2014 or just vibe out and watch the attic spiral into chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nothing bad ever happens here. Probably.</strong></p>",
